        ],
        "summary": "Resolve Case",
        "description": "Resolve the case based on whether infringing material was removed within SLA.\nIf removed: Closes case and preserves evidence log.\nIf not removed: Sets status to 'escalated' and returns complete escalation packet\n(cybercrime.gov.in, helpline 1930, and StopNCII hand-off).",
